# User-service — chạy 01-auth.http Login trước (lưu @token)
@user = {{user}}
@gateway = {{gateway}}
@token = {{token}}
@username = {{username}}
@password = {{password}}
@productId = 1

### ─── Profile ───

### Thông tin cá nhân (direct)
GET {{user}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cập nhật profile
PUT {{user}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Khang Test",
  "phone": "0901234567"
}

### Không token → 401
GET {{user}}/api/users/me

### Tìm user (staff) — CUSTOMER thường 403
GET {{user}}/api/users/search?keyword=khang&page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── Wishlist ───

### Danh sách wishlist
GET {{user}}/api/wishlist?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Thêm sản phẩm (cần productId có trong DB)
POST {{user}}/api/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": {{productId}},
  "variantId": null
}

### Kiểm tra đã thích chưa
GET {{user}}/api/wishlist/check/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Xóa theo productId
DELETE {{user}}/api/wishlist/product/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── Addresses ───

### Danh sách địa chỉ
GET {{user}}/api/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Thêm địa chỉ
POST {{user}}/api/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiverName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "province": "Ho Chi Minh",
  "district": "Quan 1",
  "ward": "Phuong Ben Nghe",
  "addressDetail": "123 Nguyen Hue",
  "isDefault": true,
  "label": "Nha"
}

### ─── Internal (debug, port 8083) ───

### Internal login (Feign — không JWT)
POST {{user}}/api/internal/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Internal get by username
GET {{user}}/api/internal/users/username/{{username}}

### ─── Gateway (:8080) ───

### Profile qua gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Wishlist qua gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/wishlist?page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Addresses qua gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Internal qua gateway → 403
GET {{gateway}}/api/internal/users/username/{{username}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
